        "description": "Prod path calls Cognito `sign_up` (email verification via Cognito hosted flow).\nReal Cognito wiring lands once a user pool exists \u2014 see infra/modules/cognito and\nspecs/02-architecture.md ADR-7. For now this validates the shape of the contract.",
